<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 29.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 29.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto (0700 GMT) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3799.27  26.24 points or 0.69 percent lower than Monday's close.</p>
